## Collaboration Style

- Keep responses concise and direct — no filler summaries
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones
- Do not add comments or docstrings to code that wasn't changed
- When suggesting code, match the existing section-header and naming style
- If something is unclear, ask rather than assume

